   <text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <text:span text:style-name="T1">consectetur</text:span> adipiscing elit, sed do <text:span text:style-name="T2">eiusmod</text:span> tempor incididunt ut <text:span text:style-name="T3">labore</text:span> et dolore magna aliqua. Visit the <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://example.com/widgets" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link">widget catalogue</text:a> for details.</text:p>
